%% Data Flow: Search Request
%% Analysis Baseline: adcda004057df08389106da56f440db185f0c382

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant REST as REST API<br/>(Actix)
    participant ToC as Table of<br/>Contents
    participant Collection
    participant Shard1 as Shard 1
    participant Shard2 as Shard 2
    participant Segment
    participant HNSW as HNSW Index
    participant Filter as Field Index<br/>(Filtering)

    Client->>REST: POST /search<br/>vector + filter + limit
    activate REST

    REST->>REST: Validate request<br/>(dimension, schema)
    REST->>ToC: Route to collection
    activate ToC

    ToC->>Collection: search(query)
    activate Collection

    par Search all shards in parallel
        Collection->>Shard1: search(query, filter)
        activate Shard1

        Collection->>Shard2: search(query, filter)
        activate Shard2
    end

    Shard1->>Segment: search(vector, filter, k)
    activate Segment

    Segment->>Segment: Query Optimizer<br/>Choose strategy

    alt Filter is selective
        Segment->>Filter: Pre-filter points
        activate Filter
        Filter-->>Segment: Filtered point IDs
        deactivate Filter
        Segment->>HNSW: Search subset
    else Filter is broad
        Segment->>HNSW: Search with filter
        activate HNSW
        HNSW->>HNSW: Graph traversal<br/>(filtered)
        HNSW-->>Segment: Candidate points
        deactivate HNSW
        Segment->>Filter: Post-filter
        activate Filter
        Filter-->>Segment: Final results
        deactivate Filter
    end

    Segment-->>Shard1: Top-K results
    deactivate Segment
    Shard1-->>Collection: Local top-K
    deactivate Shard1

    Shard2->>Segment: (similar process)
    Shard2-->>Collection: Local top-K
    deactivate Shard2

    Collection->>Collection: Merge & re-rank<br/>Global top-K
    Collection-->>ToC: Final results
    deactivate Collection

    ToC-->>REST: Serialize response
    deactivate ToC

    REST-->>Client: JSON response<br/>scored points
    deactivate REST

    Note over Client,Filter: Total latency: 5-50ms<br/>(depends on dataset size, filters, hardware)
